                "added": [
                    "*Expanding any tubing beyond its original size changes its thickness and may affects its [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dielectric dielectric] withstanding voltage. If your project or application of expanded tubing is already within close tolerances, test an expanded section of tubing first, in a safe, controlled environment."
                ],
                "removed": [
