                    "#*[[Image:JLS_Retro_PC_sleeving_large.jpg|thumb|300px|Large pliers in combination with regular pliers.]]Larger tubing will require larger pliers. Some tubing will benefit from the combination of pliers to leverage enough force to stretch thicker tubing. In this scenario, one plier's handles will expand the tubing, while the other pliers are used to pry them apart.",
